{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fe59ed1e72ac44a372c938c10f836c37d13e5e1842714009aab27ab9a13acaf2", "ja": "（環は、劇の稽古を頑張っている。\n今日も遅くまで、練習を続けているようだ……）", "zh": "（环在努力练习舞台剧。\n今天似乎也练到很晚……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1001_040tam", "source_sha256": "181141bb5cdcb555aee8b7cca9b04e2ce17603c6a03dbd435477f33ca5df843a", "ja": "ねえねえ、おやぶん。\n大人になるって、どういうことなの？", "zh": "欸欸，老大！\n变成大人是怎么回事呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1002_p", "source_sha256": "7c07dc5b548e35a791de4bcf4520f4e40a59994a80e495f7753c01d16b2c50d6", "ja": "なかなか難しい質問だな……。\nどうしたんだ、急に？", "zh": "这个问题真难回答……\n怎么突然问这个？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1003_040tam", "source_sha256": "6fade50729d112caf1ecb488cb34a4b9b459648925ebc6c5780feecef68a4900", "ja": "うん……ピーターパンとティンカーベルって、\n大人になりたくないって言うでしょ？", "zh": "嗯……\n彼得潘跟小仙子都说不想变成大人对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1004_040tam", "source_sha256": "0315d033b357313d4aebabd314a382319f27a735aaaeb78fad61e03003e58f96", "ja": "でも大人って、おやぶんも大人だよね？\n……大人になるって、そんなにイヤなことなの？", "zh": "但说到大人，老大也是大人吧？\n……变成大人是这么让人讨厌的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1005_p", "source_sha256": "7fd308c6edd370dcd8c5f14dd17d74041ac3325b85fa495bb0322ada94aededb", "ja": "なるほど、そういう事か。\n大人になるのは、別に悪い事じゃないぞ。", "zh": "原来如此，是这么一回事啊。\n变成大人不是什么坏事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1006_040tam", "source_sha256": "08ef72f2a141fb3323aa991056b443ff8944d566b1b925d59d9af217f775644f", "ja": "じゃあたまき、大人になっても\nおやぶんと一緒に遊べる？", "zh": "那等环变成大人了，\n也还能跟老大一起玩？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f1a6b560236dfafad93a2e3da52ebf64607de6781b6dd568943b049f67b18def", "ja": "もちろんだ。環が大人になっても、一緒に遊べるぞ。\nそれに環は、765プロのアイドルだからな。", "zh": "当然可以。环即使变成大人了，我们也能一起玩。\n而且环是765艺能的偶像嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1008_p", "source_sha256": "cb603aef12b0e4b2c4844dbea6efb2ad8eb00a632d84c556001071a0bd4049a2", "ja": "環がアイドルを続ける限り、ずっと、\n環のプロデューサーだ。一緒に頑張っていこうな！", "zh": "只要环还是偶像，我就永远会是你的制作人。\n我们一起努力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1009_040tam", "source_sha256": "8840ce9743fd487555b242969fe0fc0da4a8a3c35425556c686351b4eb320ea1", "ja": "おやぶん……わかった！　たまき、ずーっと\nアイドル続ける！　そんで、おやぶんと遊ぶぞ！", "zh": "老大……好！环会永──远当偶像！\n然后要跟老大一起玩！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_040tam0092_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_040tam0092_1010_040tam", "source_sha256": "a15be9b0702c045e4c4a9f37d19b031a37b1153962692ddc269ee871b8b5f07e", "ja": "大人になっても、おやぶんと一緒……。\nくふふ♪", "zh": "即使变成大人也能跟老大在一起……\n呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
